{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"root","type":"text","text":"# F｜工业与生产｜L2\n\n核心：确定性工程外壳 + 非确定性智能核心\n\n冻结目标：状态不丢 / 失败能续 / 结果能验\n状态：研究主线已收束 → 实施验证","x":0,"y":0,"width":500,"height":330,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f1","type":"text","text":"# F1｜Reliability\n能否长期持续正确？\n\nPARTIAL / 核心开放\n→ F-LONGRUN\n→ horizon / checkpoint / escalation","x":620,"y":-600,"width":430,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f2","type":"text","text":"# F2｜Durability\n中断后能否继续？\n\n较成熟\n→ F-STATE\n→ F-RECOVERY\n→ checkpoint / resume / retry","x":620,"y":-290,"width":430,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f3","type":"text","text":"# F3｜Verifiability\n怎么证明真的完成且正确？\n\nPARTIAL / 高价值\n→ Completion Contract\n→ 外部证据\n→ process + outcome eval","x":620,"y":40,"width":430,"height":280,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"f4","type":"text","text":"# F4｜Controllability\n能否只做允许的动作？\n\n快速发展\n→ least privilege\n→ sandbox / tool policy\n→ approval / trajectory monitoring","x":620,"y":390,"width":430,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f5","type":"text","text":"# F5｜Scalability\n放大后能否保持成本 / 吞吐 / 质量？\n\nPARTIAL\n→ backpressure\n→ routing / scheduling\n→ capacity / cost control","x":620,"y":720,"width":430,"height":270,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"asset","type":"text","text":"# F-ASSET｜生产资产流\n\nasset identity / URI / version / hash / manifest / provenance / permission / lifecycle\n\nP0：Local Files + Linear Attachment\nB2/COS 非 P0","x":-650,"y":-560,"width":460,"height":300,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"advanced","type":"text","text":"# 高价值未充分触碰\n\nF-IDEMPOTENCY｜幂等与副作用\nF-SAGA｜跨系统补偿事务\nF-PROVENANCE｜生产谱系\nF-LIFESPAN｜长期退化\nF-BACKPRESSURE｜背压\nF-SCHEDULING｜调度","x":-650,"y":-180,"width":460,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"chain","type":"text","text":"# 因果研究顺序\n\nLONGRUN\n↓\nSTATE\n↓\nRECOVERY\n↓\nIDEMPOTENCY\n↓\nSAGA\n↓\nASSET\n↓\nPROVENANCE\n↓\nVERIFIABLE OUTCOME / LONG-EVAL\n↓\nLIFESPAN → BACKPRESSURE → SCHEDULING","x":-650,"y":300,"width":460,"height":360,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"contracts","type":"text","text":"# 当前冻结知识\n\nCheckpoint Contract\nCompletion Contract\nAsset Manifest\nFailure Taxonomy\nRecovery Matrix\nReliability Budget\nTrajectory Evidence\n\nNEXT：真实生产实施验收，不继续无边界扩研。","x":-40,"y":500,"width":500,"height":370,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"runlog","type":"file","file":"AI问题解决Canvas/RUN_LOG_SCHEMA_v1.0.md","x":-40,"y":940,"width":500,"height":180,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"social_f","type":"text","text":"# SOCIAL-F｜社会解决状态\n\n软件工程外壳成熟；Agent 长程可靠性仍未成熟。\n\n9｜checkpoint / retry / resume / state persistence\n8–9｜幂等 / 补偿事务 / 基础 observability\n5–6｜Agent 长程可靠性\n3–4｜24h 无人创意生产\n\n结论：不要研究成熟软件工程本身，要研究它包住非确定性 AI 后是否仍可靠。","x":-1280,"y":720,"width":520,"height":390,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"social_f_absorb","type":"text","text":"# ABSORB｜7–10\n\ncheckpoint / retry / resume\nstate persistence / logging\nhash / manifest / provenance 基础\nidempotency / transaction / compensation\nbackpressure / scheduler 基础\n\n动作：工程实现，停止当研究题。","x":-1840,"y":660,"width":470,"height":340,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"social_f_adapt","type":"text","text":"# ADAPT｜4–6\n\nAgent checkpoint 存什么\n非确定性 retry 策略\nAI asset provenance\nAgent failure taxonomy\nlong-task observability\n\n动作：适配本地 4080 + Linear + Worker/Codex 工作流。","x":-1280,"y":1160,"width":500,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"social_f_research","type":"text","text":"# RESEARCH｜开放缺口\n\n核心：24h 创意生产可靠性\n\n成熟工程外壳 + 非确定性模型\n→ 是否能长期连续生产？\n→ 错误是否累积 / 扩散？\n→ 恢复后是否保持创作状态？\n\n证据：MAP 2026 将 reliability 列为生产 Agent 首要挑战；Datadog 2026 仍观察到明显生产调用失败与容量瓶颈。","x":-700,"y":1160,"width":520,"height":350,"color":"2"}
	],
